{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reign of demons is over, the reckoning has come. Descend into hell where unending hordes of infernal creatures await. None shall stand in the way of your blaze. Their power is beneath your evergrowing might.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hellborn: No Survivors</strong> is a unique take on the <i>survivors-like/bullet heaven</i> genre. Take on <i>waves</i> of enemies to find and collect powerful <i>relics</i>, with a chance to get <i>rare relics</i> with <i>game-changing effects</i> from <i>elite</i> opponents. <i>Level up</i> as you kill enemies and <i>evolve your attacks</i> when they reach a threshold. Use <i>attribute points</i> to strengthen your base stats and spend <i>souls</i> to <i>upgrade</i> your relics or <i>craft</i> new ones. <i>Evolve into your true form</i> to take on even stronger enemies in <i>act 2</i>. But be careful, as stronger enemies inflict <i>wither</i> upon you, which consumes you slowly and is difficult to cure. Take on <i>bosses</i> with two phases and unique attacks at the end of each act.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock, level up and evolve attacks of flame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the souls of fallen enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, craft and upgrade ancient relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve into your true form</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sacrifices and receive blessings at the altar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against common or elite waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cure the wither before it consumes you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on infernal bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer music by\u00a0Eclipzodiac</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022420?t=176634