ent relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve into your true form</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sacrifices and receive blessings at the altar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against common or elite waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cure the wither before it consumes you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on infernal bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer music by\u00a0Eclipzodiac</p>","developers":["Ascend4ncy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022420/8a8f6000e6fc5f776f979cb8a8f2daa454aa1ba6/header.jpg?t=1766343315","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022420/975340440/ae331b372aacdff2c078be12b704d1b9a0e2bb2f/1762544528/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762544750","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022420/975340440/ae331b372aacdff2c078be12b704d1b9a0e2bb2f/1762544528/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762544750","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022420/975340440/ae331b372aacdff2c078be12b704d1b9a0e2bb2f/1762544528/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762544750","id":257228341,"name":"Hellborn_Trailer_1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257228341/8c24fe934d06c32b9545b5fbc08a1796d635f638/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762544750"}],"name":"Hellborn: No Survivors","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_32 CPU with SSE2 instructions, any x86_64 CPU, ARMv8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB a